    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.13_evidence_grammar_quality.sections.02_diagrammatic_grammar_inspection.concrete_anchor_13_piquotientprojection#pi_quotient_projection" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_13_evidence_grammar_quality_sections_02_diagrammatic_grammar_inspection_concrete_anchor_13_piquotientprojection#pi_quotient_projection silm:hasLongDescription "The pi_quotient_projection is the projection from Free(G_11) onto O_11 = Free(G_11)/R_11 enforcing the relator equations. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'pi_quotient_projection', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
